
## `.gitignore`

For your current HTML/CSS/JS calculator, you don't have many things that need ignoring. Still, use a professional `.gitignore`:

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production

# Build / distribution
dist/
build/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE / editor files
.vscode/
.idea/

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Backup files
*.bak
*.swp